                      "type": "markdown",
                      "testid": "lp-docs-markdown",
                      "className": "lp-docs-markdown",
                      "content": "## 五分钟安装\n\n```bash\npnpm add @nop-chaos/flux-react @nop-chaos/flux-renderers-basic\n```\n\n注册渲染器后即可渲染第一份 schema：\n\n```ts\nimport { createSchemaRenderer, createDefaultRegistry } from '@nop-chaos/flux-react';\nimport { registerBasicRenderers } from '@nop-chaos/flux-renderers-basic';\n\nconst registry = createDefaultRegistry();\nregisterBasicRenderers(registry);\nexport const SchemaRenderer = createSchemaRenderer();\n```\n\n> **约定**：布局渲染器只输出 marker class，视觉样式全部来自 schema 的 `className` 与设计令牌。"
